# Inquiry form delivery ------------------------------------------------------
# Web3Forms access key. Get one at https://web3forms.com by entering
# incom2794@naver.com — the key is emailed to that address, and every
# submission is delivered to it.
#
#   1. cp .env.example .env
#   2. paste the key below
#   3. pnpm build   (or restart pnpm dev)
#
# Without this key the form does not pretend to send; it tells the visitor the
# relay is not connected and shows the email address instead.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
